---
import discovery from '../assets/align/discovery.png';
const root=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<article class="project-feature align-feature" aria-labelledby="align-feature-heading">
<header class="feature-heading"><p class="micro">04 / Evidence + decisions · Independent concept</p><h3 id="align-feature-heading">ALIGN</h3></header>
<div class="feature-story"><h4>Understand the opportunity before committing.</h4><p>Bring job conditions, candidate preferences and unknowns into an inspectable Decision Brief. Separate exploration, private comparison and explicit application review.</p><p class="project-boundary">Independent, AI-assisted prototype · Fictional listings and candidate data. No real application delivery.</p></div>
<figure class="project-visual"><a class="feature-artifacts align-feature-artifacts" href={`${root}work/align/`} aria-label="View the ALIGN case study"><img src={discovery.src} width={discovery.width} height={discovery.height} alt="Original ALIGN M06 responsive discovery capture with mobile and desktop job information and a Decision Brief." loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></a><figcaption>Conditions, evidence and uncertainty in one view.<span>Historical M06 capture · Linked prototype uses R05.</span></figcaption></figure>
<div class="feature-details feature-footer"><dl class="feature-contribution"><dt>My contribution</dt><dd>Product direction and iterative feedback, with AI-assisted design exploration, documentation, implementation and checks.</dd></dl><div class="project-actions"><a class="text-link" href={`${root}work/align/`}>Read the ALIGN case study <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={`${root}prototypes/align/`}>Explore the ALIGN prototype <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
</article>
<style is:global>.homepage .project-feature .align-feature-artifacts{grid-template-columns:1fr;background:#e6ece4;border-color:#b9cbbb;padding:clamp(1rem,2.8vw,2.5rem)}html[data-theme=dark] .homepage .project-feature .align-feature-artifacts{background:#28372d;border-color:#526954}.homepage .align-feature-artifacts img{width:100%;height:auto;max-width:none}</style>
